OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says he and Xi Jinping
OL,8,Fheld a "great meeting" in the White
OL,9,FHouse, as the Chinese leader continues
OL,10,Fhis three-day US visit
OL,12,FThe US president spoke briefly to
OL,13,Freporters before Xi left the White
OL,14,FHouse - the pair will attend a state
OL,15,Fdinner later, joined by tech moguls and
OL,16,FAI bosses
OL,18,FBefore the meeting, Trump said the US
OL,19,Fand China had made "tremendous strides
OL,20,Fon the issues facing our two countries"
