OL,7,FTrump said he and Xi would discuss
OL,8,F"security, technology and super
OL,9,Fintelligence" - the US president's name
OL,10,Ffor artificial intelligence
OL,12,FPresident Xi, meanwhile, called for
OL,13,F"continued dialogue" with the US and
OL,14,Fhoped that "Chinese companies are
OL,15,Ftreated fairly here"
